-- Typechecks cleanly. The first #ASSERT holds; the second evaluates cleanly
-- to FALSE. A failed assertion is a failed test, so `l4 run` on this file
-- exits 1. `l4 check` does not evaluate, so it succeeds.

GIVEN x IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`twice` x MEANS x TIMES 2

#ASSERT `twice` 2 EQUALS 4
#ASSERT `twice` 2 EQUALS 5
